help: Replace with `check_access`
   |
8  |         self.check_access_rights("read")
   -         self.check_access_rule("write")
9  +         self.check_access("write")
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

ODW8502 [*] `_filter_access_rules` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `_filtered_access` instead; an override belongs in `_check_access`.
